#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![The Jordan-Wigner transpiled LUCJ circuit.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/lucj-7.avif)\n"
msgstr "![The Jordan-Wigner transpiled LUCJ circuit.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/lucj-7.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This pipeline is exactly what [`generate_preset_jw_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-presets-generate-preset-jw-pass-manager#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_jw_pass_manager \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_jw_pass_manager\") assembles, so reach for the preset in practice and build the stages by hand when you need to change one of them:\n"
msgstr "Ang pipeline na ito mismo ang binubuo ng [`generate_preset_jw_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-presets-generate-preset-jw-pass-manager#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_jw_pass_manager \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_jw_pass_manager\"), kaya sa praktika ay gamitin ang preset at buuin nang mano-mano ang mga stage kapag kailangan mong baguhin ang isa sa mga ito:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"match-the-device-topology\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "5. Match the device topology {#5-match-the-device-topology}"
msgstr "5. Itugma ang topology ng device {#5-match-the-device-topology}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A real device has a restricted qubit coupling map, and the LUCJ ansatz is designed to match it. The same-spin (`pairs_aa`) interactions form two linear chains and the alpha-beta (`pairs_ab`) interactions bridge them. ffsim’s [`generate_lucj_pass_manager()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.qiskit.generate_lucj_pass_manager.html#ffsim.qiskit.generate_lucj_pass_manager \"(in ffsim)\") builds a device-aware qubit pipeline for this structure, and returns the subset of `pairs_ab` the hardware can actually accommodate. Slot that pipeline into the preset’s `qubit` stage while keeping the package’s own fermion-to-qubit synthesis:\n"
msgstr "Ang tunay na device ay may limitadong qubit coupling map, at ang LUCJ ansatz ay dinisenyo para tumugma rito. Ang same-spin (`pairs_aa`) na mga interaksyon ay bumubuo ng dalawang linear chain at ang alpha-beta (`pairs_ab`) na mga interaksyon ang tumutulay sa mga ito. Ang [`generate_lucj_pass_manager()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.qiskit.generate_lucj_pass_manager.html#ffsim.qiskit.generate_lucj_pass_manager \"(in ffsim)\") ng ffsim ay bumubuo ng device-aware na qubit pipeline para sa istrukturang ito, at ibinabalik ang subset ng `pairs_ab` na talagang kayang tanggapin ng hardware. Isalang ang pipeline na iyon sa `qubit` stage ng preset habang pinapanatili ang sariling fermion-to-qubit synthesis ng package:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "That composition is the point: the `qubit` stage is device-aware, while the fermion-to-qubit synthesis stage ahead of it stays this package’s own, and so stays replaceable. Replacing the `qubit` stage does drop what the preset registers there, which is the [`HopEvolutionSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-synthesis-hop-evolution-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.HopEvolutionSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.HopEvolutionSynthesis\") that turns the Givens factors of an orbital rotation into [`XXPlusYYGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XXPlusYYGate)objects. Pass it on through the `hls_config` as above, or the device’s basis has to be reached without it.\n"
msgstr "Iyon ang punto ng komposisyon: ang `qubit` stage ay device-aware, habang ang fermion-to-qubit synthesis stage na nauuna rito ay nananatiling sa package na ito, kaya nananatiling napapalitan. Ang pagpapalit sa `qubit` stage ay nag-aalis ng nirerehistro ng preset doon, na siyang [`HopEvolutionSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-synthesis-hop-evolution-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.HopEvolutionSynthesis \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.synthesis.HopEvolutionSynthesis\") na ginagawang mga [`XXPlusYYGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XXPlusYYGate)object ang mga Givens factor ng isang orbital rotation. Ipasa ito sa pamamagitan ng `hls_config` gaya ng nasa itaas, o kailangang maabot ang basis ng device nang wala ito.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With `pm.qubit` now set to the device-aware pipeline, running the pass manager lays the circuit out on the backend’s qubits and routes it to the coupling map. For the *unrestricted* ansatz from step 1, whose diagonal Coulomb operator still contains alpha-beta terms the hardware cannot reach directly, the router must insert many `SWAP` gates to bridge them:\n"
msgstr "Dahil naka-set na ang `pm.qubit` sa device-aware na pipeline, ang pagpapatakbo ng pass manager ay naglalatag ng circuit sa mga qubit ng backend at nagru-route nito sa coupling map. Para sa *unrestricted* na ansatz mula sa hakbang 1, na ang diagonal Coulomb operator ay naglalaman pa rin ng mga alpha-beta term na hindi direktang maabot ng hardware, kailangang magpasok ang router ng maraming `SWAP` gate para tulayan ang mga ito:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Restrict the ansatz to the hardware-implementable interactions**\n"
msgstr "**Limitahan ang ansatz sa mga interaksyong kayang ipatupad ng hardware**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The fix is to feed `allowed_pairs_ab` back into the ansatz construction, through the `interaction_pairs` argument of [`from_t_amplitudes()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.UCJOpSpinBalanced.html#ffsim.UCJOpSpinBalanced.from_t_amplitudes \"(in ffsim)\"), so the diagonal Coulomb operator only contains alpha-beta terms the coupling map can implement directly. The ansatz then matches the device topology and the router barely has to touch it:\n"
msgstr "Ang solusyon ay ibalik ang `allowed_pairs_ab` sa pagbuo ng ansatz, sa pamamagitan ng argument na `interaction_pairs` ng [`from_t_amplitudes()`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/stubs/ffsim.UCJOpSpinBalanced.html#ffsim.UCJOpSpinBalanced.from_t_amplitudes \"(in ffsim)\"), para ang diagonal Coulomb operator ay maglaman lamang ng mga alpha-beta term na direktang kayang ipatupad ng coupling map. Tumutugma na ang ansatz sa topology ng device at halos hindi na kailangang galawin ng router:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Drawing only the active qubits (`idle_wires=False`) shows the circuit restricted to the two spin chains and the alpha-beta bridge, expressed in the device basis gates. Layout and routing scatter the logical modes across the device’s physical qubits, so pass a `wire_order` taken from the circuit’s final layout ([`final_index_layout()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.TranspileLayout#final_index_layout) lists the physical qubit each input qubit ended on, in input-qubit order) to draw the wires back in the original mode order:\n"
msgstr "Ang pagguhit lamang sa mga aktibong qubit (`idle_wires=False`) ay nagpapakita ng circuit na limitado sa dalawang spin chain at sa alpha-beta na tulay, na naka-express sa mga basis gate ng device. Ikinakalat ng layout at routing ang mga logical mode sa mga pisikal na qubit ng device, kaya magpasa ng `wire_order` na kinuha mula sa final layout ng circuit (inililista ng [`final_index_layout()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.TranspileLayout#final_index_layout) ang pisikal na qubit kung saan napunta ang bawat input qubit, ayon sa pagkakasunod ng input-qubit) para iguhit muli ang mga wire sa orihinal na pagkakasunod ng mode:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![The hardware-restricted LUCJ circuit routed onto the heavy-hex device coupling map.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/lucj-12.avif)\n"
msgstr "![The hardware-restricted LUCJ circuit routed onto the heavy-hex device coupling map.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/lucj-12.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"Note\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  The exact post-layout gate counts and depth depend on the routing/optimization passes and the chosen device, so they are not reproduced here. The key point is the co-design; expressing the ansatz with a nearest-neighbor `pairs_aa` chain and hardware-filtered `pairs_ab` bridges keeps the synthesized circuit close to the device topology, minimizing the routing overhead (inserted `SWAP` gates). See [`FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-synthesis-fermionic-slater-givens-decomposition#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition\") for a related synthesis choice (`minimize_2q_gate_count`), trading two-qubit gate count against routed depth.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"Note\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  Ang eksaktong bilang ng gate at depth pagkatapos ng layout ay nakadepende sa mga routing/optimization pass at sa napiling device, kaya hindi ito inilalahad dito. Ang pangunahing punto ay ang co-design; ang pag-express ng ansatz gamit ang nearest-neighbor na `pairs_aa` chain at hardware-filtered na `pairs_ab` na mga tulay ay nagpapanatiling malapit sa topology ng device ang na-synthesize na circuit, na nagpapaliit sa routing overhead (mga ipinasok na `SWAP` gate). Tingnan ang [`FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-synthesis-fermionic-slater-givens-decomposition#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicSlaterGivensDecomposition\") para sa kaugnay na pagpili sa synthesis (`minimize_2q_gate_count`), na nagpapalit ng bilang ng two-qubit gate laban sa routed depth.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

